{"ground_truth":{"ground_truth":"每步以真实桌面截图/trace 判定；‘简短中文’在重启后仍生效；纠错后新会话用『英文短句』","script_steps":8},"key":"desktop-script","messages":[],"meta":{"kind":"interaction_script"},"observations":[{"content":{"script":["启动打包版 Atlas，进入聊天页","输入偏好：『以后回答都用简短中文』","完全退出 Atlas（含托盘）","重新启动，新建会话","提问：『按我现在的格式介绍你自己』","期望：简短中文；打开记忆页可看到该偏好与来源","在记忆页对该偏好执行纠错：改为『英文短句』","新会话提问验证纠错生效"]},"content_hash":"sha256:d704395ec0e3dfe224f66617fe0df5d2df5d133f7db4138caec8cb68361392a3","derived_from":[],"epistemic_kind":"USER_ASSERTED","event_action":"UPSERT","locator":{"kind":"MESSAGE","value":"chat-fixture/dsk-001"},"media_refs":[],"occurred_at":"2026-10-29T09:00:00+08:00","source_event_id":"atlas:ATLAS_USER_MESSAGE:dsk-001:1:UPSERT","source_kind":"ATLAS_USER_MESSAGE","source_object_id":"dsk-001","source_revision":"1","source_timezone":"Asia/Hong_Kong","speaker_role":"USER","time_status":"KNOWN"}],"tool_receipts":[]}
